DejaVu Fonts (https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/)
==============================================

The DejaVu fonts in this directory (DejaVuSans.ttf, DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf) are
derived from the Bitstream Vera Fonts and are released under a permissive
license that permits free use, modification, and redistribution — including
embedded in a binary. The full license text follows.

